{"text":"purananuru","n":193,"lines":["அதள்எறிந் தன்ன நெடுவெண் களரின்","ஒருவன் ஆட்டும் புல்வாய் போல","ஓடி உய்தலும் கூடும்மன்","ஒக்கல் வாழ்க்கை தட்கும்மா காலே"],"tr":["ataḷeṟin taṉṉa neṭuveṇ kaḷariṉ","oruvaṉ āṭṭum pulvāy pōla","ōṭi uytalum kūṭummaṉ","okkal vāḻkkai taṭkummā kālē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"potuviyal","tinai_ta":"பொதுவியல்","turai_ta":"பொருண்மொழிக் காஞ்சி","poet_ta":"ஓரேருழவர்","poet_tr":"Ōrēruḻavar"},"scan":{"meter":"nilaimaṇṭila āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"4 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"4×4 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 15, veṇcīr 1"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 10, veṇṭaḷai 5"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"அதளெறிந்","tr":"ataḷeṟin","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"அத","tr":"ata"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ளெறிந்","tr":"ḷeṟin"}]},{"text":"தன்ன","tr":"taṉṉa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தன்","tr":"taṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ன","tr":"ṉa"}]},{"text":"நெடுவெண்","tr":"neṭuveṇ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"நெடு","tr":"neṭu"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வெண்","tr":"veṇ"}]},{"text":"களரி","tr":"kaḷari","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கள","tr":"kaḷa"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரி","tr":"ri"}]}],[{"text":"னொருவ","tr":"ṉoruva","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"னொரு","tr":"ṉoru"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வ","tr":"va"}]},{"text":"னாட்டும்","tr":"ṉāṭṭum","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"னாட்","tr":"ṉāṭ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டும்","tr":"ṭum"}]},{"text":"புல்வாய்","tr":"pulvāy","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"புல்","tr":"pul"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வாய்","tr":"vāy"}]},{"text":"போல","tr":"pōla","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"போ","tr":"pō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ல","tr":"la"}]}],[{"text":"வோடி","tr":"vōṭi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வோ","tr":"vō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டி","tr":"ṭi"}]},{"text":"யுய்த","tr":"yuyta","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யுய்","tr":"yuy"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"த","tr":"ta"}]},{"text":"லும்கூ","tr":"lumkū","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"லும்","tr":"lum"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கூ","tr":"kū"}]},{"text":"டும்ம","tr":"ṭumma","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"டும்","tr":"ṭum"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ம","tr":"ma"}]}],[{"text":"னொக்கல்","tr":"ṉokkal","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"னொக்","tr":"ṉok"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கல்","tr":"kal"}]},{"text":"வாழ்க்கை","tr":"vāḻkkai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வாழ்க்","tr":"vāḻk"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கை","tr":"kai"}]},{"text":"தட்கும்மா","tr":"taṭkummā","foot":"tēmāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தட்","tr":"taṭ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கும்","tr":"kum"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மா","tr":"mā"}]},{"text":"காலே","tr":"kālē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லே","tr":"lē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"அதள்","parts":[{"text":"அதள்","lemma":"அதள்","gloss":"leather/skin"}],"gloss":"leather/skin"},{"surface":"எறிந்தன்ன","parts":[{"text":"எறிந்து","lemma":"எறி","gloss":"having spread/thrown"},{"text":"அன்ன","lemma":"அன்ன","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like spread out"},{"surface":"நெடு","parts":[{"text":"நெடு","lemma":"நெடு","gloss":"vast/long"}],"gloss":"vast"},{"surface":"வெண்","parts":[{"text":"வெண்","lemma":"வெள்","gloss":"white"}],"gloss":"white"},{"surface":"களரின்","parts":[{"text":"களர்","lemma":"களர்","gloss":"saline soil"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"locative suffix"}],"gloss":"in the saline wasteland"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஒருவன்","parts":[{"text":"ஒருவன்","lemma":"ஒருவன்","gloss":"one man"}],"gloss":"one man"},{"surface":"ஆட்டும்","parts":[{"text":"ஆட்டும்","lemma":"ஆட்டு","gloss":"chasing/driving"}],"gloss":"chasing"},{"surface":"புல்வாய்","parts":[{"text":"புல்வாய்","lemma":"புல்வாய்","gloss":"deer"}],"gloss":"deer"},{"surface":"போல","parts":[{"text":"போல","lemma":"போல்","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஓடி","parts":[{"text":"ஓடி","lemma":"ஓடு","gloss":"having run"}],"gloss":"having run"},{"surface":"உய்தலும்","parts":[{"text":"உய்தல்","lemma":"உய்","gloss":"escaping"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"and/also"}],"gloss":"and escaping"},{"surface":"கூடும்","parts":[{"text":"கூடும்","lemma":"கூடு","gloss":"is possible"}],"gloss":"is possible"},{"surface":"மன்","parts":[{"text":"மன்","lemma":"மன்","gloss":"indeed (particle of regret)"}],"gloss":"indeed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஒக்கல்","parts":[{"text":"ஒக்கல்","lemma":"ஒக்கல்","gloss":"kin/relatives"}],"gloss":"kin/relatives"},{"surface":"வாழ்க்கை","parts":[{"text":"வாழ்க்கை","lemma":"வாழ்க்கை","gloss":"life"}],"gloss":"life"},{"surface":"தட்கும்","parts":[{"text":"தட்கும்","lemma":"தடு","gloss":"hinders/restrains"}],"gloss":"hinders"},{"surface":"ஆ","parts":[{"text":"ஆ","lemma":"ஆ","gloss":"alas (exclamation)"}],"gloss":"alas"},{"surface":"காலே","parts":[{"text":"கால்","lemma":"கால்","gloss":"leg/foot"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"the leg indeed"}]}],"literal":"Like a leather skin spread out, in the vast white saline wasteland, / like a deer chased by a man, / running and escaping is indeed possible, / but the life with relatives hinders the leg, alas!","translation":"Like a deer chased by a hunter in a vast, white saline wasteland that looks like a spread-out hide, one could easily run and escape. But alas, a life bound to one's kin restrains the feet.","modern":"பரப்பி வைக்கப்பட்ட தோலைப் போன்ற பெரிய வெண்மையான களர் நிலத்தில், ஒருவனால் துரத்தப்படும் மானைப் போல, ஓடித் தப்பிப் பிழைப்பது சாத்தியம்தான். ஆனால், சுற்றத்தாருடன் கூடி வாழும் வாழ்க்கையானது கால்களைத் தடுத்து நிறுத்துகிறது.","explanation":"The poet Oreruzhavar reflects on the tension between personal freedom and familial duty in this Porunmozhi Kanchi poem. He compares a struggling individual to a deer being chased by a hunter across a barren, wide-open saline desert. While it is physically possible to run away and escape the hardships of life, the attachment to one's dependent relatives acts as a shackle. The vivid image of the saline wasteland looking like a stretched-out hide emphasizes the harshness and exposure of the world. Ultimately, the poem highlights how love and responsibility for one's kin prevent a person from simply fleeing their troubles.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}